cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this app in teaching materials or a publication, you may cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Electromagnetics Visualization Hub: an interactive Streamlit app for series expansions and the Laplace equation"
abstract: >-
  A single-file Streamlit teaching app for undergraduate electromagnetics:
  Fourier and Legendre series approximations, the 2D and 3D Laplace equation
  by finite differences and analytic solutions, and the potential and field
  of point charges and continuous charge distributions, with interactive
  plots in the browser.
authors:
